{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 26,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Cain Murders Abel"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Adam knew Eve his wife, and she conceived and bore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Acquire"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Cain, and said, “I have acquired a man from the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ".” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then she bore again, this time his brother "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Breath or Nothing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abel. Now Abel was a keeper of sheep, but Cain was a tiller of the ground. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. at the end of days"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in the process of time it came to pass that Cain brought an offering of the fruit of the ground to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ". "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Abel also brought of the firstborn of his flock and of their fat. And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " respected Abel and his offering, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but He did not respect Cain and his offering. And Cain was very angry, and his countenance fell."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Cain, “Why are you angry? And why has your countenance fallen? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If you do well, will you not be accepted? And if you do not do well, sin lies at the door. And its desire "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. toward"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for you, but you should rule over it.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Cain "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. said to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "talked with Abel his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Sam., LXX, Syr., Vg. add “Let us go out to the field.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "brother; and it came to pass, when they were in the field, that Cain rose up against Abel his brother and killed him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Cain, “Where "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Abel your brother?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He said, “I do not know. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I my brother’s keeper?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said, “What have you done? The voice of your brother’s blood cries out to Me from the ground. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So now you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " cursed from the earth, which has opened its mouth to receive your brother’s blood from your hand. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When you till the ground, it shall no longer yield its strength to you. A fugitive and a vagabond you shall be on the earth.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Cain said to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", “My "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "iniquity"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "punishment "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " greater than I can bear! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Surely You have driven me out this day from the face of the ground; I shall be hidden from Your face; I shall be a fugitive and a vagabond on the earth, and it will happen "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " anyone who finds me will kill me.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, Tg.; LXX, Syr., Vg. Not so;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Therefore, whoever kills Cain, vengeance shall be taken on him sevenfold.” And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " set a mark on Cain, lest anyone finding him should kill him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Family of Cain"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Cain went out from the presence of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and dwelt in the land of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Wandering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nod on the east of Eden. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Cain knew his wife, and she conceived and bore Enoch. And he built a city, and called the name of the city after the name of his son—Enoch. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "To Enoch was born Irad; and Irad begot Mehujael, and Mehujael begot Methushael, and Methushael begot Lamech."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Lamech took for himself two wives: the name of one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Adah, and the name of the second "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Zillah. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Adah bore Jabal. He was the father of those who dwell in tents and have livestock. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "His brother’s name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jubal. He was the father of all those who play the harp and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "pipe"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "flute. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And as for Zillah, she also bore Tubal-Cain, an instructor of every craftsman in bronze and iron. And the sister of Tubal-Cain "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Naamah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Lamech said to his wives:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Adah and Zillah, hear my voice;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Wives of Lamech, listen to my speech!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "slain a man for my wound"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "killed a man for wounding me,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Even a young man "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "for my hurt"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for hurting me."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If Cain shall be avenged sevenfold,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Lamech seventy-sevenfold.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "A New Son"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Adam knew his wife again, and she bore a son and named him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Appointed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Seth, “For God has appointed another seed for me instead of Abel, whom Cain killed.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And as for Seth, to him also a son was born; and he named him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. Enos, Luke 3:38"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Enosh. Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " began to call on the name of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}